  "program": "flood-market-access",
  "analysis": "decomposition of the flood_market_access_index — size ranking vs market access",
  "claim_scope": "Deepening of the hypothesis-stage screen. Reproduces the committed (rural_pct/100) x annual_flood_events x log10(population) index from the on-disk panel, then strips the two size-dominated terms (log10(population); the raw EM-DAT qualifying-event count) to test whether the top-4 {AFG,CHN,IDN,IND} is a market-access signal or a country-size-and-disaster-reporting ranking. Triage measure (CONSTITUTION.md §6.4), not a risk ranking. The index contains no road, no market, no travel time, and no flood footprint; the DMC framing (§13.3) is a measurement / observability gap.",
